WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:03.730
OF NEXT MONTH.

00:00:03.732 --> 00:00:04.388
SANDRA?

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:06.336
&gt;&gt; Sandra: THANK YOU.

00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:09.723
&gt;&gt; Ed: AS WE PAUSE TO REMEMBER

00:00:09.757 --> 00:00:11.071
OUR BRAVE SERVICEMEN AND WOMEN,

00:00:11.106 --> 00:00:12.543
THE DEPARTMENT OF VETERANS

00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:15.995
AFFAIRS IS DEALING WITH A TOUGH

00:00:16.029 --> 00:00:17.076
ISSUE.

00:00:17.077 --> 00:00:20.572
MOST MEMORIAL DAY IS ONLINE, DUE

00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:22.223
TO PANDEMIC RESTRICTIONS.

00:00:22.257 --> 00:00:23.713
ONE FLORIDA CONGRESSMAN IS

00:00:23.714 --> 00:00:25.292
OBJECTING, AN ARMY VET WRITING

00:00:25.326 --> 00:00:27.083
THIS, "WITH MANY PARTS OF OUR

00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:28.845
COUNTRY NOW IN THE PROCESS OF A

00:00:28.846 --> 00:00:30.191
PHASE REOPENING, I FIND IT

00:00:30.192 --> 00:00:31.675
APPALLING THAT BEACHES WILL BE

00:00:31.676 --> 00:00:34.918
OPEN FOR THE HOLIDAY BUT ACCESS

00:00:34.919 --> 00:00:36.693
TO VA CEMETERIES WILL REMAIN

00:00:36.694 --> 00:00:36.934
RESTRICTED.

00:00:36.935 --> 00:00:38.083
SO THE SECRETARY OF VETERANS

00:00:38.084 --> 00:00:40.556
AFFAIRS IS JOINING US LIVE NOW,

00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:41.699
GOOD MORNING, SIR.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.023
&gt;&gt; GOOD MORNING, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:43.430
HAVING ME.

00:00:43.431 --> 00:00:46.248
&gt;&gt; Ed: I WANT TO GIVE YOU A

00:00:46.249 --> 00:00:48.938
CHANCE TO RESPOND TO THAT, BUT I

00:00:48.939 --> 00:00:51.131
WOULD BE REMISS TO NOT START BY

00:00:51.165 --> 00:00:52.701
GIVING YOU A CHANCE TO TALK

00:00:52.703 --> 00:00:54.916
ABOUT WHAT IT’S LIKE TO SERVE

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.380
THIS GREAT NATION HAS A VA

00:00:56.415 --> 00:00:57.210
SECRETARY AS THE PRESIDENT LEADS

00:00:57.244 --> 00:00:59.424
THE NATION IN MARKING THIS

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:00.469
MEMORIAL DAY.

00:01:00.504 --> 00:01:03.910
&gt;&gt; AS SOME OF YOU KNOW, I AM THE

00:01:03.944 --> 00:01:05.212
SON OF A GRIEVOUSLY WOUNDED

00:01:05.213 --> 00:01:05.986
COMBAT SOLDIER.

00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:09.863
I STILL SERVE IN THE AIR FORCE

00:01:09.898 --> 00:01:11.358
RESERVE, MY EARLIEST MEMORIES

00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:12.507
AREN’T ELEMENTARY IN

00:01:12.508 --> 00:01:13.808
KINDERGARTEN, AND I’VE OFTEN

00:01:13.842 --> 00:01:15.362
SAID THAT WHEN A CLASSMATE WAS

00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:17.414
CALLED TO THE PRINCIPAL’S OFFICE

00:01:17.449 --> 00:01:19.681
DURING THOSE TIMES IN MY YOUTH,

00:01:19.715 --> 00:01:21.482
THERE WAS ALWAYS A CHANCE THAT

00:01:21.517 --> 00:01:23.684
THAT CHILD WASN’T GOING TO A

00:01:23.718 --> 00:01:24.649
DOCTOR’S APPOINTMENT, THAT IT

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.594
WAS BAD NEWS FROM SOUTHEAST

00:01:25.596 --> 00:01:26.038
ASIA.

00:01:26.039 --> 00:01:29.284
SO I WAS ABLE TO SEE THIS

00:01:29.319 --> 00:01:31.452
THROUGH THE EYES OF A CHILD NOT

00:01:31.453 --> 00:01:33.161
ONLY WITH MY FATHER’S RECOVERY

00:01:33.162 --> 00:01:35.803
COME UP THE LOSS OF SO MANY OF

00:01:35.837 --> 00:01:37.148
HIS COMRADES PARTICULARLY AT

00:01:37.149 --> 00:01:39.518
FORT BRAGG, THE HOME OF SPECIAL

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:41.469
FORCES AND OF COURSE THE HOME OF

00:01:41.504 --> 00:01:42.422
THE 82ND AIRBORNE DIVISION.

00:01:42.423 --> 00:01:45.523
THE ONE THING I ALWAYS TALK

00:01:45.558 --> 00:01:47.721
ABOUT, AND I’VE SAID THIS TODAY

00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:48.571
AT QUANTICO NATIONAL CEMETERY,

00:01:48.573 --> 00:01:50.590
THE ONE THING THAT SEPARATES THE

00:01:50.625 --> 00:01:51.627
AMERICAN WARRIOR FROM ALL OTHER

00:01:51.629 --> 00:01:53.714
FIGHTING FORCES IN THE HISTORY

00:01:53.748 --> 00:01:56.878
OF THE WORLD IS THAT WE ARE THE

00:01:56.879 --> 00:01:58.303
ONLY PEOPLE TO OFFER A HELPING

00:01:58.337 --> 00:02:00.921
HAND TO ALL THE PEOPLES OF THE

00:02:00.922 --> 00:02:02.634
WORLD INCLUDING OUR ENEMIES, AND

00:02:02.668 --> 00:02:04.239
AS GENERAL POWELL SAID SO

00:02:04.241 --> 00:02:06.029
ELOQUENTLY, THE ONLY THING WE

00:02:06.031 --> 00:02:08.809
EVER ASK IS A PLACE TO BURY OUR

00:02:08.844 --> 00:02:10.892
DEAD, AND I THINK THAT’S A

00:02:10.926 --> 00:02:13.049
FITTING MEMORIAL TO ALL OF THE

00:02:13.051 --> 00:02:15.108
OVER 1 MILLION AMERICANS WHO

00:02:15.109 --> 00:02:17.198
HAVE PERISHED SINCE THE FIRST

00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:19.366
SHOTS WERE FIRED IN LEXINGTON IN

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.478
APRIL OF 1775.

00:02:20.513 --> 00:02:23.372
&gt;&gt; Ed: VERY WELL SAID, AS WE

00:02:23.406 --> 00:02:25.161
TALK ABOUT THOSE WHO ARE BURIED,

00:02:25.162 --> 00:02:26.068
IT’S A DIFFICULT SUBJECT

00:02:26.069 --> 00:02:27.667
OBVIOUSLY IN THE MIDDLE OF THIS

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:29.323
PANDEMIC ABOUT WHAT TO DO TO

00:02:29.357 --> 00:02:30.381
GIVE PEOPLE A CHANCE TO HONOR

00:02:30.382 --> 00:02:31.703
THE DEAD.

00:02:31.705 --> 00:02:34.083
SO WE MENTIONED HE’S A WARRIOR

00:02:34.118 --> 00:02:35.735
HIMSELF AS YOU KNOW, HE WAS

00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:38.196
GRIEVOUSLY WOUNDED AS WELL, A

00:02:38.197 --> 00:02:40.062
VETERAN, AND HIS POINT IS IN THE

00:02:40.063 --> 00:02:41.148
LETTER THAT AMERICANS SHOULD

00:02:41.149 --> 00:02:43.237
HAVE THE FREEDOM TO MOURN AND

00:02:43.272 --> 00:02:44.999
PAY THEIR RESPECTS IN THE MANNER

00:02:45.034 --> 00:02:46.081
THEY JUDGE IS BEST FOR

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:48.762
THEMSELVES AND THEIR GROUPS.

00:02:48.763 --> 00:02:51.485
SO TALK ABOUT WHY YOU DECIDED

00:02:51.486 --> 00:02:53.262
WE’VE GOT TO CLOSE OFF THE VA

00:02:53.297 --> 00:02:54.541
CEMETERY, WHAT OTHER WAYS ARE

00:02:54.543 --> 00:02:57.856
YOU OFFERING FOR PEOPLE TO MOURN

00:02:57.858 --> 00:02:59.735
AND WHAT YOU THINK THEY MAY

00:02:59.769 --> 00:03:00.610
ULTIMATELY SAY?

00:03:00.611 --> 00:03:02.752
&gt;&gt; LET ME DO SOMETHING HARD AND

00:03:02.786 --> 00:03:04.219
CORRECT THE CONGRESSMAN.

00:03:04.254 --> 00:03:06.555
WE HAVE 142 VA CEMETERIES, NOT

00:03:06.589 --> 00:03:08.209
ONE OF THEM HAS EVER CLOSED

00:03:08.211 --> 00:03:09.551
DURING THIS EPIDEMIC.

00:03:09.585 --> 00:03:12.124
I JUST SPOKE AT THE QUANTICO

00:03:12.126 --> 00:03:13.450
NATIONAL CEMETERY, AND AS I WAS

00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:16.475
SPEAKING, I WAS LOOKING OUT AT

00:03:16.476 --> 00:03:17.910
FAMILIES COLLECTING TO

00:03:17.945 --> 00:03:19.402
MEMORIALIZE THEIR LOVED ONES.

00:03:19.437 --> 00:03:20.554
THAT’S HAPPENING ALL ACROSS THE

00:03:20.588 --> 00:03:21.573
COUNTRY.

00:03:21.574 --> 00:03:23.995
WHAT WE HAD STOPPED WHERE

00:03:23.996 --> 00:03:25.466
GATHERINGS OF LARGE GROUPS LIKE

00:03:25.467 --> 00:03:26.337
THE BOY SCOUTS.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.318
IN FACT, HE ISSUED A STATEMENT

00:03:28.319 --> 00:03:30.672
EARLIER LAST WEEK WITH THE

00:03:30.706 --> 00:03:32.656
BOY SCOUT LEADERSHIP BECAUSE

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:33.624
THOUSANDS AND THOUSANDS OF

00:03:33.625 --> 00:03:36.420
BOY SCOUTS WOULD HAVE BEEN AN

00:03:36.421 --> 00:03:38.287
ERROR CEMETERIES PLANTING FLAGS,

00:03:38.288 --> 00:03:40.477
THE SCOUT LEADERSHIP DECIDED IN

00:03:40.511 --> 00:03:43.389
TERMS OF SAFETY FOR THEM THAT

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:45.570
THEY WOULD HONOR VETERANS

00:03:45.572 --> 00:03:48.482
THROUGH A VIRTUAL CELEBRATION

00:03:48.483 --> 00:03:50.846
AND TODAY, 3:00 ALL ACROSS THE

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.212
COUNTRY, SCOUTS WILL PARTICIPATE

00:03:53.213 --> 00:03:54.674
IN OUR VETERANS LEGACY PROJECT,

00:03:54.708 --> 00:03:58.651
AND THEY WILL BE STANDING AT

00:03:58.686 --> 00:04:00.960
ATTENTION AS THE BUGLER BLOWS

00:04:00.962 --> 00:04:02.116
"TAPS" AND SALUTES.

00:04:02.117 --> 00:04:04.225
IN SANDRA’S LEAD INTO THE

00:04:04.226 --> 00:04:05.613
CEREMONY AT ARLINGTON, SHE NOTED

00:04:05.647 --> 00:04:06.834
THAT THE ARLINGTON NATIONAL

00:04:06.868 --> 00:04:08.056
CEMETERY WHICH IS RUN BY THE

00:04:08.057 --> 00:04:10.379
DEPARTMENT OF THE ARMY FOR THE

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.429
PRESIDENT WAS TODAY, THE

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.327
FAMILIES WERE THERE, THE

00:04:12.328 --> 00:04:14.855
FAMILIES WHERE THEY ARE DOING

00:04:14.889 --> 00:04:16.958
WHAT IS MOST IMPORTANT, AND THAT

00:04:16.993 --> 00:04:18.095
IS MEMORIALIZING AND REMEMBERING

00:04:18.096 --> 00:04:19.484
THEIR LOVED ONES, AND I THINK OF

00:04:19.519 --> 00:04:22.692
ALL THE THINGS THAT WE DO, THAT

00:04:22.726 --> 00:04:24.190
IS THE MOST IMPORTANT, THE MOST

00:04:24.191 --> 00:04:26.248
IMPORTANT ELEMENT OF WHAT WE

00:04:26.282 --> 00:04:28.853
GIVE TO THE NATION, AND THEY

00:04:28.887 --> 00:04:34.067
WERE ABLE TO PERFORM THOSE

00:04:34.102 --> 00:04:34.972
SACRED RESPONSIBILITIES.

00:04:35.007 --> 00:04:36.756
&gt;&gt; Ed: RESTRICTED, THE

00:04:36.758 --> 00:04:38.570
CONGRESSMAN IS SAYING.

00:04:38.604 --> 00:04:42.356
HOW DO YOU JUSTIFY THAT, THAT

00:04:42.358 --> 00:04:43.906
FAMILIES HAVE RESTRICTED ACCESS

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:45.220
TO THESE CEMETERIES?

00:04:45.222 --> 00:04:46.826
&gt;&gt; THE FAMILIES HAVE ACCESS,

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:49.693
THAT’S THE KEY, AND THEY’VE ALSO

00:04:49.694 --> 00:04:51.600
HAD ACCESS WHEN WE’VE HAD OUR

00:04:51.601 --> 00:04:52.868
BURIALS, AND THOSE BURIALS HAVE

00:04:52.869 --> 00:04:56.425
BEEN GOING ON ALL ACROSS THE

00:04:56.427 --> 00:04:59.279
COUNTRY, BUT I WILL WOULD ALSO N

00:04:59.281 --> 00:05:00.686
THIS WAS HINTED IN THE ARLINGTON

00:05:00.687 --> 00:05:00.890
PEAS.

00:05:00.891 --> 00:05:02.830
WE HAVEN’T HAD THE BENEFIT OF

00:05:02.832 --> 00:05:04.037
THE DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE HONOR

00:05:04.038 --> 00:05:06.092
GUARDS, THOSE HAVE BEEN STOPPED

00:05:06.094 --> 00:05:06.951
FOR SAFETY REASONS.

00:05:06.952 --> 00:05:10.282
WE WILL RETURN OUR CEMETERIES TO

00:05:10.283 --> 00:05:11.818
FULLY USE VERY SHORTLY, AND IT

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:15.062
IS A TRAGEDY IN ONE SENSE THAT

00:05:15.063 --> 00:05:16.538
WE HAVEN’T BEEN ALLOWED TO BRING

00:05:16.539 --> 00:05:18.411
MASSES OF THE AMERICAN PEOPLE

00:05:18.446 --> 00:05:20.308
INTO OUR CEMETERIES AS LONG AS

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:21.519
THE FAMILIES ARE ALLOWED TO GO,

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:23.463
THAT’S THE MOST IMPORTANT PART

00:05:23.464 --> 00:05:25.525
OF WHAT WE DO.

00:05:25.526 --> 00:05:28.886
&gt;&gt; Ed: IT CERTAINLY IS AND HE

00:05:28.887 --> 00:05:31.464
WAS A YOUNG BOY DEALING WITH IT,

00:05:31.465 --> 00:05:33.303
AND SOME KIDS BEING CALLED TO

00:05:33.305 --> 00:05:34.271
THE PRINCIPAL’S OFFICE TO FIND

00:05:34.305 --> 00:05:37.206
OUT THAT THEY’VE LOST A MOM OR

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:38.938
DAD OR AN UNCLE OR AUNT, WE

00:05:38.972 --> 00:05:39.242
CERTAINLY APPRECIATE YOUR

